                "caption": "Figure 2:From uniform to heterogeneous refinement.(a) In vanilla JiT(Li and He, 2026), every hidden dimension is updated at\nevery block, yielding the same refinement budgetRi=LR_{i}=L.\n(b) Our design updates only the firstdℓd_{\\ell}dimensions at layerℓ\\ellwhile bypassing the remaining.\nVaryingdℓd_{\\ell}across depth assigns different refinement budgets to\ndifferent feature dimensions.",
